  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO WFP 2014 Rwanda/Egypt M&amp;E KS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JPO WFP 2014 Rwanda/Egypt M&amp;E KS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is addressing the Agenda 2030 goal 2: Zero hunger. Thematic area is Agriculture &amp; Food security. JPO program (Junior Professional Officers) are an important part of the total Swedish focus on increased Swedish participation in  international organizations. The program offers young graduates the   opportunity to serve in the UN and other international organizations.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tj&#xe4;nsten riktar sig mot Agenda 2030 m&#xe5;let 2: Ingen Hunger. Den tematiska inriktningen &#xe4;r jordbruk och mats&#xe4;kerhet. JPO programmet med WFP har fungerat ypperligt bra. Uppf&#xf6;ljning sker av WFP samt Sida. Innehavaren av en JPO tj&#xe4;nst utv&#xe4;rderar sin tj&#xe4;nst &#xe5;rligen och m&#xf6;ter Sida personal vid seminarier etc.</narrative>
  </description>
